  "releaseNotes": "New Features:\n\t\t\t- Added multi-language support! You can now fetch holidays in Turkish (default) or English using the 'HolidayLanguage' enum.\n\n\t\t\tImprovements and Changes:\n\t\t\t- Renamed 'HolidayService' to 'TurkeyHolidaysService' to prevent naming conflicts with other packages.\n\t\t\t- Updated namespace structure to follows .NET best practices (.Services, .Enums).\n\n\t\t\tBackward Compatibility:\n\t\t\t- The old 'HolidayService' class is preserved but marked as [Obsolete]. Your existing code will continue to work with a warning, giving you time to migrate.",
